{"id":"n25382-1-7","stage":4,"title":"초대 · 首任","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25382-1-7-1","ko":"너 우리 학교 초대 학장이 누군지 아니?","zh":"你知道我们学院的首任院长是谁吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"초대","meaning":"首任，第一任","explanation":"초대：首任，第一任","readings":[{"term":"초대","audio":"/audio/856ec7123cfd1961ec3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25382","senseId":"1","lemma":"초대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학장이","meaning":"院长","explanation":"학장：院长；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학장","audio":"/audio/ac80069bd0978cfbacf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84148","senseId":"1","lemma":"학장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누군지","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아니?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"856ec7123cfd1961","term":"초대","zh":"首任，第一任","audio":"/audio/856ec7123cfd1961ec3b.mp3","entryId":"25382","definition":"对某职位或地位实行任期制时，指第一位上任的人。","pronunciation":["초대"]},{"id":"ac80069bd0978cfb","term":"학장","zh":"院长","audio":"/audio/ac80069bd0978cfbacf4.mp3","entryId":"84148","definition":"管理并负责单科学院全部事务的人。","pronunciation":["학짱"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b35d3ea91f6bd64a7f43.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25382-1-7-2","ko":"그럼. 지금도 학장님 이름의 장학금이 있잖아.","zh":"当然，现在还有以院长名字命名的奖学金。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼.","meaning":"可不是，就是，当然","explanation":"그럼：可不是，就是，当然","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금도","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학장님","meaning":"院长","explanation":"학장：院长；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"학장","audio":"/audio/ac80069bd0978cfbacf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84148","senseId":"1","lemma":"학장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이름의","meaning":"名字，名称","explanation":"이름：名字，名称；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"1","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장학금이","meaning":"奖学金","explanation":"장학금：奖学金；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장학금","audio":"/audio/5d03ab909004ed1d049e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71210","senseId":"1","lemma":"장학금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있잖아.","meaning":"就是","explanation":"있다：就是；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"7","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"可不是，就是，当然","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"62277","definition":"用于肯定回答，表示自不必说，没有疑问。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"ac80069bd0978cfb","term":"학장","zh":"院长","audio":"/audio/ac80069bd0978cfbacf4.mp3","entryId":"84148","definition":"管理并负责单科学院全部事务的人。","pronunciation":["학짱"]},{"id":"253d1510caf53620","term":"이름","zh":"名字，名称","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3","entryId":"71692","definition":"为了区别于他物，给动物、事物、现象等而赋予的称号。","pronunciation":["이름"]},{"id":"5d03ab909004ed1d","term":"장학금","zh":"奖学金","audio":"/audio/5d03ab909004ed1d049e.mp3","entryId":"71210","definition":"发给成绩优秀，但因贫困而学习遇到困难的学生的钱。","pronunciation":["장ː학끔"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"就是","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"用于强调或确认某个对象或事实。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8a5d7215230121162295.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.833,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25382","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["当然，现在还有以院长名字命名的奖学金。","你知道我们学院的首任院长是谁吗？","咦？怎么突然所有灯都熄灭了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你知道我们学院的首任院长是谁吗？","咦？怎么突然所有灯都熄灭了？","当然，现在还有以院长名字命名的奖学金。"],"answer":2}]}
